# Bite Down on Crime with only five mana value in the graveyard (Faithless Looting 1, Hero of Bladehold 4, a discarded Swamp 0)
# cannot collect evidence 6 (CR 701.59a: it can't be chosen at all), so it is cast without, for the full {3}{G}: all four
# sources are spent and nothing is left over. Grizzly Bears, 2/2, gets +2/+0 and deals its 4 power to Wall of Stone (0/8);
# the pump is over at the end of the turn, so on Bot2's turn 4 the Bears are 2/2 again. CR 601.2f, 701.59a, 514.2.

